{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34805","headline":"山中 · 司空图","name":"山中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"全家与我恋孤岑，蹋得苍苔一径深。\n逃难人多分隙地，放生麋大出寒林。\n名应不朽轻仙骨，理到忘机近佛心。\n昨夜前溪骤雷雨，晚晴闲步数峰吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}